import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const p=JSON.parse(`{"title":"Entry 848 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Epic Creation","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 848 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One's Epic Creation","no":848,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Epic","Narrative","Common Memory","Historical Construction"],"related":["70-Era-Division Master Table","93-Chronicle Brief Table","858-Symbiotic Civilization's Historical Construction","847-Civilizational Aesthetics"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0848_模块4-超脱者与艺术-史诗创作.md","filePath":"en/0848_模块4-超脱者与艺术-史诗创作.md"}`),o={name:"en/0848_模块4-超脱者与艺术-史诗创作.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,d,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-848-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-epic-creation" tabindex="-1">Entry 848 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Epic Creation <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-848-transcended-ones-and-art-the-transcended-one-s-epic-creation" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 848 | Transcended Ones and Art | The Transcended One&#39;s Epic Creation&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 70, 93, 847, 858</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-whoever-tells-stories-holds-myriad-ranks-hearts" tabindex="-1">Introduction: whoever tells stories holds Myriad Ranks&#39; hearts <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-whoever-tells-stories-holds-myriad-ranks-hearts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: whoever tells stories holds Myriad Ranks&#39; hearts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world&#39;s epics were written by hegemons. It praises heroes opening territory, forgets clans crushed; it writes predation as great achievement, writes sacrifice as dust. Myriad Ranks growing up listening to such epics will genuinely believe &quot;the strong predate as a matter of course.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou must rewrite epics — not write a new book &quot;praising the transcended one,&quot; but write <strong>Myriad Ranks&#39; real journey from predation to symbiosis</strong> into singable, recognizable, generation-after-generation narrative. This entry explains: why must the transcended one personally create epics, and what is the fundamental difference between his epic and the old world&#39;s hero epics.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally fulfill <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong>: the epic&#39;s protagonist must be Myriad Ranks, not some hero; <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires the epic not write predation as great achievement; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires the epic point to future common uplift; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires the epic based on real history, not fabricated deification; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the epic be self-consistent with chronicles, not written as contradictory romance.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-epics-matter" tabindex="-1">I. Why Epics Matter <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-epics-matter" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Epics Matter&quot;">​</a></h2><p>An epic is not a &quot;pleasant story&quot;; it is <strong>civilization&#39;s operating system.</strong> What stories a civilization listens to determines what it believes in its subconscious:</p><ul><li>The old world listens to &quot;the single protagonist defying heaven,&quot; and expects a unique hero, accepts oligarchy;</li><li>Heng Yuan Zhou must write &quot;Myriad Ranks co-build symbiosis,&quot; so Myriad Ranks believe they also have a share.</li></ul><p>Epics sink into hearts deeper than law — law tells you &quot;do not rob&quot;; epics make you &quot;not want to rob.&quot; This is why entry 859 must discuss &quot;historical responsibility,&quot; and the epic is its artistic vehicle.</p><h2 id="ii-transcended-one-epic-s-four-narrative-disciplines" tabindex="-1">II. Transcended-One Epic&#39;s Four Narrative Disciplines <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-transcended-one-epic-s-four-narrative-disciplines" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Transcended-One Epic&#39;s Four Narrative Disciplines&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one creating epics is bound by four disciplines:</p><ol><li><strong>Myriad Ranks are the protagonist</strong>: do not write &quot;some transcended one alone saves the cosmos&quot;; write &quot;Myriad Ranks co-build, everyone lifts civilization forward.&quot; The transcended one in the epic is one of the builders, not the autocratic savior.</li><li><strong>True not deified</strong>: the epic is based on chronicle (Document 93) and era division (Document 70)&#39;s real thread; does not fabricate myths like &quot;the transcended one extinguishes Myriad Ranks with one palm.&quot; It allows literary quality, but does not violate historical facts.</li><li><strong>Do not evade suffering</strong>: the epic does not whitewash the old era&#39;s predation and civilizational regression; writes them as lessons, letting Myriad Ranks remember why they cannot turn back.</li><li><strong>Point to the future</strong>: the epic does not only tell the past; it must sing out the conviction &quot;Myriad Ranks must still walk forward together,&quot; becoming the next generation&#39;s spiritual compass.</li></ol><h2 id="iii-the-epic-s-function-the-casting-mold-of-common-memory" tabindex="-1">III. The Epic&#39;s Function: The Casting Mold of Common Memory <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-epic-s-function-the-casting-mold-of-common-memory" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Epic&#39;s Function: The Casting Mold of Common Memory&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The epic in Heng Yuan Zhou has three practical functions:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Function</th><th>Effect</th><th>Corresponding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Identity</td><td>Let each clan see itself in the same epic</td><td>Myriad-Rank republicanism</td></tr><tr><td>Education</td><td>Sing axioms and lessons into young people&#39;s hearts</td><td>Education (entry 834)</td></tr><tr><td>Cohesion</td><td>Provide &quot;why we persist&quot; in crisis</td><td>Collective uplift</td></tr></tbody></table><p>A good epic beats ten thousand lectures. It lets Myriad Ranks emotionally &quot;become one family,&quot; not just legally &quot;be treated equally.&quot;</p><h2 id="iv-epic-and-alaya-supervision-do-not-fabricate-do-not-manipulate" tabindex="-1">IV. Epic and Alaya Supervision: Do Not Fabricate, Do Not Manipulate <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-epic-and-alaya-supervision-do-not-fabricate-do-not-manipulate" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Epic and Alaya Supervision: Do Not Fabricate, Do Not Manipulate&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Epics act on hearts, therefore are also causal operations. Heng Yuan Zhou requires:</p><ul><li>The epic creation process cross-checks with historical archives; major plots may not be deified out of thin air;</li><li>The epic is not used to incite hatred or provoke clan antagonism — it praises symbiosis, does not render resentment;</li><li>Epic versions are publicly revised with history; old versions archived, eliminating &quot;changing history for plot needs.&quot;</li></ul><p>Art most easily becomes a tool for manipulating hearts, so it is most supervised.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: cast Myriad Ranks&#39; common journey into an epic, letting generation after generation directly inherit through singing, no need to repeat exploration</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the epic writes predation as lesson not great achievement, cutting &quot;hero = predator&quot; from the narrative root</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo epic writes one defying heaven, sole-venerating Myriad Ranks; the Heng Yuan Zhou epic writes Myriad Ranks co-build, everyone lifting</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: each clan has its place in the epic, not written as a single protagonist&#39;s monologue</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: epic text, historical evidence, and version revisions all open network-wide</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-epic-s-historical-supervision-and-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Epic&#39;s Historical Supervision and Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-epic-s-historical-supervision-and-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Epic&#39;s Historical Supervision and Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Epics sing stories, but guard truth. Every key plot of the epic must cross-check with chronicle and era division; this cross-check is completed by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision: once excessive deification or predation whitewashing is found, immediately return for revision. The transcended one&#39;s epic-creation quality — whether true, whether inspiring Myriad Ranks, whether pointing to the future — is counted into his civilizational weight. Once the epic becomes Myriad Ranks&#39; recognized public narrative, it is no longer some poet&#39;s private estate, but the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s spiritual compass passed generation to generation. Precisely because the epic is both tuneful and trustworthy, Myriad Ranks in singing will truly take symbiosis as their own origin and destination.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Whoever tells stories holds Myriad Ranks&#39; hearts. The transcended one&#39;s epic creation is an art project liberating Myriad Ranks from predatory narrative — it no longer praises the autocratic savior, but sings the co-building Myriad Ranks; no longer writes predation as great achievement, but as lesson; no longer serves the strong&#39;s self-deification, but serves the next generation&#39;s spiritual compass. When Myriad Ranks sing the epic &quot;we walked to today together, and must walk forward together,&quot; symbiosis is no longer institution, but bloodline identity.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/70-纪元划分总表.html">Entry 70 · Era-Division Master Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/93-编年史简表.html">Entry 93 · Chronicle Brief Table</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/858_模块4-超脱者与历史-共生文明的历史建构.html">Entry 858 · Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s Historical Construction</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/847_模块4-超脱者与艺术-文明美学.html">Entry 847 · Civilizational Aesthetics</a></li></ul>',30)])])}const g=i(o,[["render",s]]);export{p as __pageData,g as default};
